[{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0100","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10174","title":"NETGEAR WNR2000v5 路由器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NETGEAR WNR2000v5 路由器在 /apply.cgi?/lang_check.html 接口的 hidden_lang_avi 参数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该溢出，导致远程代码执行，完全控制目标路由器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，且已有公开的 Metasploit 利用模块，攻击门槛低。NETGEAR 官方未发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户更换不受影响的设备型号或采取访问控制等缓解措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10174"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-01-30T04:59:00.157","updated":"2026-06-17T00:39:12.707","remediation":"NETGEAR 已不再为 WNR2000v5 提供安全更新，建议立即更换为受支持的设备。如无法更换，请关闭路由器的远程管理功能（禁用 WAN 端 Web 访问），并将管理界面仅绑定到内网可信 IP；同时在防火墙规则中阻止外网对 TCP 80/443 端口的访问，以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://kb.netgear.com/000036549/Insecure-Remote-Access-and-Command-Execution-Security-Vulnerability","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2016/Dec/72","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/95867","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pedrib/PoC/master/advisories/netgear-wnr2000.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40949/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41719/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-10174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41719","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10174.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-10174","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-10174.rules","https://github.com/elastic/kibana/blob/83d1507553478043f1635b8450db9a0d059a40dd/x-pack/solutions/security/packages/data-table/mock/demo_data/timeline.ts","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-10174/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/pedrib/PoC/blob/3d8e58284be35d1893dbba8a7d33c27ed9e88352/advisories/netgear-wnr2000.txt","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/NETGEAR/MSF/Wnr2000_rce_infos.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/27414.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0088","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10033","title":"PHPMailer mail函数参数注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHPMailer 5.2.18 之前版本中的 mail 函数存在参数注入漏洞。攻击者可通过向使用 PHPMailer 的 Web 应用提交特制的发件人邮箱地址，在 mail() 函数调用中注入额外的命令行参数，从而绕过安全限制执行任意代码。该漏洞影响大量使用 PHPMailer 的 CMS 系统（如 WordPress、Joomla 等），远程未认证攻击者无需任何权限即可利用，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10033"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-12-31","updated":"2016-12-31","remediation":"立即将 PHPMailer 升级至 v5.2.18 或更高版本（https://github.com/PHPMailer/PHPMailer/releases/tag/v5.2.18）。使用 WordPress 4.6 的用户应升级至 4.7+，该版本已内置修复后的 PHPMailer。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 mail.add_x_header 并限制 sendmail_path 参数传递，同时避免在邮件地址参数中直接拼接用户输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40974","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10033.yaml","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/multi/http/phpmailer_arg_injection","https://github.com/PHPMailer/PHPMailer/releases/tag/v5.2.18","https://github.com/PHPMailer/PHPMailer/wiki/About-the-CVE-2016-10033-and-CVE-2016-10045-vulnerabilities","https://legalhackers.com/advisories/PHPMailer-Exploit-Remote-Code-Exec-CVE-2016-10033-Vuln.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40968/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40969/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40970/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40974/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40986/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41962/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41996/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42024/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42221/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-10033","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10033.md","https://github.com/PHPMailer/PHPMailer/blob/4a489474e7ef8bbf03c1cb219d8939ea76a7fb40/changelog.md","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/CVE-2016-10033/README.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/_sidebar.md","https://github.com/koutto/jok3r/blob/076199667835c29f6f7128dc6e89e36aae089981/TODO.rst","https://github.com/opsxcq/exploit-CVE-2016-10033/blob/c2e5f875170dc5eb82599e2b02430d49283b4583/deface.sh","https://github.com/OWASP/joomscan/blob/2ea8cc7792b3893b80a52e4ad7cc32a1a9dbf7fc/exploit/db/corevul.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/26586.txt","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2016/CVE-2016-10033.md","https://github.com/jvoisin/snuffleupagus/blob/f782b1c7ac9f374aa214175372f6ce811f1e0959/doc/source/features.rst","https://github.com/opsxcq/exploit-CVE-2016-10033","https://github.com/GeneralTesler/CVE-2016-10033","https://github.com/Zenexer/safeshell","https://github.com/paralelo14/CVE_2016-10033","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2016-10033"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0001","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-9535","title":"LibTIFF libtiff Predictor 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"LibTIFF 图像处理库 4.0.6 及之前版本中的 tif_predict.h 与 tif_predict.c 文件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理带有 YCbCr 子采样等特殊 tile 尺寸的 TIFF 文件时，断言检查不足会在调试模式下导致断言失败，在发布模式下则触发堆缓冲区溢出。攻击者可借助特制 TIFF 图像文件实现远程代码执行，或通过 tiffutil 等组件导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个操作系统及下游应用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-9535"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2016-11-22T19:59:03.387","updated":"2026-06-17T00:56:11.710","remediation":"升级 libtiff 至 4.0.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了 tif_predict.c 中对异常 tile 尺寸（如 YCbCr subsampling）的边界检查缺陷，消除了堆缓冲区溢出风险。Apple macOS 用户应安装 2017 年安全更新或升级至 10.12.4 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，应避免处理来源不可信的 TIFF 文件，特别是包含非标准 tile 尺寸的图像，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017-0225.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-3844","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94484","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94744","https://github.com/vadz/libtiff/commit/3ca657a8793dd011bf869695d72ad31c779c3cc1","https://github.com/vadz/libtiff/commit/6a984bf7905c6621281588431f384e79d11a2e33","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2016/CVE-2016-9535.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2016/9xxx/CVE-2016-9535.json","https://github.com/fullwaywang/QlRules/blob/241853bffb1f550aca9b1eba7b1c65f00f09ae18/libtiff/CVE-2016-9535_6a984bf/fpAcc-autogen.ql","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-9535","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2016/UBUNTU-CVE-2016-9535.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/593bdbc51deef90595839eb5f1cfcb624c57384b/2016/9xxx/CVE-2016-9535.json","https://github.com/Erroristotle/AutoTrace/blob/af1f3345928a5652dfbfa615ac0407c39e459143/results/CVE-2016-9535/slices/fixed/CVE-2016-9535_sp_reconstructed.c","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2016-9535","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-9535.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9mr5-78vv-g6xr/GHSA-9mr5-78vv-g6xr.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0011","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0189","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 脚本引擎内存损坏漏洞","description":"Microsoft JScript 和 VBScript 脚本引擎存在内存损坏漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页触发脚本引擎在处理对象时的越界写入或释放后重用错误，未经身份认证的远程攻击者诱导用户访问该恶意网站即可利用此漏洞，在目标系统上执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 9 至 11 及使用相关脚本引擎的其他 Microsoft 产品，CVSS 评分为 7.5，属于高危级别。Microsoft 于 2016 年 5 月安全更新（MS16-051）中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0189"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-05-11T01:59:30.537","updated":"2026-06-17T00:37:05.163","remediation":"用户要求为 CVE-2016-0189 生成 remediation 字段（修复建议）。\n\n已知信息：\n- CVE-2016-0189\n- Microsoft JScript/VBScript 引擎内存损坏漏洞\n- 影响 Internet Explorer 9-11\n- CVSS 7.5 (HIGH)\n- MS16-051\n- ExploitDB 有 PoC: https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40118\n\n要求：\n1. 中文修复建议\n2. ≥20字\n3. 具体操作：升级版本、配置修改、缓解措施\n4. 不要套话如「请参考官方公告」\n5. 必须给出可操作步骤\n\nCVE-2016-0189 是 Microsoft 在 2016 年 5 月发布的安全更新 MS16-051 中修复的。这是一个 Internet Explorer 的 VBScript/JScript 引擎内存损坏漏洞。\n\n修复建议应该包括：\n1. 安装 MS16-051 安全更新（KB3156754）\n2. 升级 IE 版本\n3. 缓解措施（禁用 VBScript/JScript、使用其他浏览器等）\n\n让我先搜索一下这个漏洞的具体修复信息。基于 MS16-051 安全公告的信息，CVE-2016-0189 的修复建议如下：\n\n1. 安装 MS16-051 安全更新（KB3155533），该更新修复了 Internet Explorer 中 JScript 和 VBScript 引擎的内存损坏问题。\n2. 对于 Windows 10 用户，通过 Windows Update 安装更新 KB3156387。\n3. 缓解措施：禁用 VBScript 和 JScript（通过命令行限制对 vbscript.dll 和 jscript.dll 的访问），或使用 EMET 来缓解攻击。\n\n让我撰写一个符合要求的修复建议。<value>安装 Microsoft 2016 年 5 月安全更新 MS16-051（KB3155533），该更新修复了 Internet Explorer 9/10/11 中 JScript 与 VBScript 引擎的内存损坏缺陷。具体操作：通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或手动从 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载并安装对应系统的补丁（Windows 7/8.1/10 等）。如无法立即打补丁，可在命令行中对 32 位系统执行 `takeown /f %windir%\\system32\\vbscript.dll && cacls %windir%\\system32\\vbscript.dll /E /P everyone:N && cacls %windir%\\system32\\jscript.dll\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90012","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035820","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-051","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40118/","https://www.virusbulletin.com/virusbulletin/2017/01/journey-and-evolution-god-mode-2016-cve-2016-0189/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0189","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40118","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0189.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/34ec06c5d813d44f45c11d453307aba73a1b3508/2016/CVE-2016-0189.json","https://github.com/k-vitali/Malware-Misc-RE/blob/4c49fd57e28a7aace9631f022391aedafd714f56/2019-06-25-rig-exploit-kit-landing-script-decoded-cve-2016-0189.vk.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0189","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/139%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/3685dbbe18cee3bc5e1b47aca09a60dc2e29ea4d/2016/CVE-2016-0189.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/theori-io/cve-2016-0189/blob/ed013ba66ddc0ecdace85be1f3239e4fac05e421/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0189.txt","https://github.com/LyleMi/Browser-Fuzz-Summarize/blob/372eaa7d563d63cc2d151db65ed5e67404454133/source/ref/vuln.rst","https://github.com/theori-io/cve-2016-0189","https://github.com/deamwork/MS16-051-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0009","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0185","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Center 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Media Center 存在远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 .mcl (Media Center Link) 文件，诱导用户打开后触发漏洞，在用户权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1 和 Windows 8.1 系统，CVSS 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地且需要用户交互 (AV:L/UI:R)，攻击复杂度低且无需特权 (AC:L/PR:N)，成功利用可完全控制受影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意 .mcl 文件，利用方式为诱导用户点击恶意媒体中心链接文件触发代码执行。Microsoft 已在 MS16-059 安全公告中修复此漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0185"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-05-11T01:59:26.097","updated":"2026-06-17T00:37:04.663","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 发布的 MS16-059 安全更新（对应补丁 KB3156016 等），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装，修复 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1 中 Windows Media Center 对恶意 .mcl 文件处理的远程代码执行漏洞。若无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 .mcl 文件关联（删除 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\.mcl 及 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\MCLFile），或在“启用或关闭 Windows 功能”中关闭 Windows Media Center 功能，减少攻击面；同时在网络层面配置防火墙限制非必要的文件共享与远程访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90023","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035832","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-16-277","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39805/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0185","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39805","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21