026-06-17T00:37:02.890","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 4 月安全更新 (MS16-039)，对应补丁：Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB3143141，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB3143142，Windows 10 1511 安装 KB3147458，Windows 10 RTM 安装 KB3147461。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可临时限制本地用户权限，移除非必要用户的管理员权限，并启用 AppLocker 限制未签名应用程序执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035529","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035532","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-039","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0167","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0167.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c50b42f02438e6d2727eef5fecc301070143fae/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0167.json","https://github.com/leeqwind/HolicPOC/blob/58705c366b5acfe366cab5ad535a710775ba9897/windows/win32k/CVE-2016-0167/README.md","https://github.com/jekil/awesome-hacking/blob/3cb71ba9ab1ba31737dfbde9d3f1bba6c10627ba/_pages/index.rst","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0167.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0167.html","https://github.com/KennaSecurity/All_Samples/blob/3a3629a8a3257533214ca82507864d0f1651c282/VI-Notebooks/cves.txt","https://github.com/aw-junaid/Hacking-Tools/blob/62711d1b0ad3259f44b647a05da2680c094c9d6e/Penetration%20Testing/Hacking%20tools%20for%20hackers.rst","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2016-0167.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-0167.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0007","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0165","title":"Microsoft Windows 图形组件特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核模式驱动程序 (win32k.sys) 存在特权提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意应用程序调用内核驱动中的特定图形处理函数，触发内核内存破坏或权限检查绕过，从而将权限从普通用户提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2、Windows RT 8.1 以及 Windows 10 早期版本（RTM 和 1511），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH）。攻击条件要求攻击者已获得本地普通用户权限并能执行代码，需诱导用户运行精心构造的恶意应用程序触发漏洞。攻击者可利用该漏洞执行任意内核代码，完全控制目标系统，微软已于 2016 年 4 月补丁日（MS16-039）发布补丁修复，ExploitDB 等公开存在可利用 PoC 代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0165"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-04-12T23:59:28.303","updated":"2026-06-17T00:37:02.613","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 4 月安全更新（MS16-039，KB3145739），该系统更新可修复 Windows 内核模式驱动程序中 win32k 组件内存对象处理不当导致的特权提升漏洞；对于 Windows 10 系统，应安装对应的累积更新 KB3147461（32 位）或 KB3147458（1511 版本）。如系统配置为自动更新，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取并安装。该漏洞暂无变通方案，建议在确认系统重启时间窗口后尽快安排补丁部署，并在安装完成后立即重启系统以确保更新生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035529","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035532","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-039","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44480/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0165","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44480","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0165.md","https://github.com/leeqwind/HolicPOC/blob/58705c366b5acfe366cab5ad535a710775ba9897/windows/win32k/CVE-2016-0165/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2016/CVE-2016-0165.json","https://github.com/jekil/awesome-hacking/blob/3cb71ba9ab1ba31737dfbde9d3f1bba6c10627ba/_pages/index.rst","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/325d4883b5fe156c18fd47e477e38a13d3899546/README_202104.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0165.html","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/9b338e6d7e327e411224114413ae6967b0a8ad79/doc/2022-06/CVE-2016-0165%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/30187.txt","https://github.com/aw-junaid/Hacking-Tools/blob/62711d1b0ad3259f44b647a05da2680c094c9d6e/Penetration%20Testing/Hacking%20tools%20for%20hackers.rst","https://github.com/xqx12/daily-info/blob/f89413f27063960293cde4e697eb944bfe558859/2021/tech_info_20210403.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0006","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0162","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 9 至 11 版本存在信息泄漏漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 JavaScript 代码，在用户浏览器中执行并检测目标系统上特定文件的存在与否。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，用户只需访问包含恶意脚本的网页即可被利用。影响范围涵盖所有受支持的 IE 9/10/11 版本，攻击者可借此获取服务器端文件路径信息，为后续攻击提供情报支持。Microsoft 已于 2016 年 4 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0162"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-04-12T23:59:26.410","updated":"2026-06-17T00:37:02.340","remediation":"建议立即升级到支持的现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Chrome、Firefox 或 Safari），并确保使用 Internet Explorer 时升级到 Windows 10 并安装最新的累积更新（至少 KB4013443 或更高版本）。如无法立即使用现代浏览器，可在 Internet Explorer 下禁用 ActiveX，并配置组策略禁用标签页功能，以减少信息泄漏风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/85939","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035521","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-037","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0162","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0162.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0162","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0162.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0162.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0162.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-gq2g-gj23-9684/GHSA-gq2g-gj23-9684.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2016-0162.md","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/Twitter/Zube/2016/2016_12_08.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0005","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0151","title":"Microsoft Windows CSRSS 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Windows CSRSS（客户端-服务器运行时子系统）在处理进程令牌时存在权限管理缺陷，未正确验证会话 0 进程创建过程中的权限提升请求。攻击者需在目标系统上以本地用户身份登录，并运行特制的应用程序，即可利用此漏洞获取 SYSTEM 级别的特权权限，从而提升本地权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012（Gold 和 R2）、Windows RT 8.1 以及 Windows 10 Gold 和 1511 版本。由于攻击条件要求本地用户先登录系统，属于本地提权漏洞，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危），被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。Microsoft 通过 MS16-048 安全补丁修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0151"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-04-12T23:59:15.890","updated":"2026-06-17T00:37:00.880","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 5 月安全更新 MS16-048 (KB3156387)，通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载对应补丁包安装。受影响系统包括 Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2、Windows RT 8.1、Windows 10 1507/1511。无法立即打补丁的系统，可暂时限制本地用户登录权限，禁用非必要的本地账户，并部署应用程序白名单策略限制未授权程序执行作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows 10 1607 或更高版本、Windows Server 2016 或更高版本彻底修复该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035544","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-048","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39740/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0151","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39740","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0151.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0151","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0151.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0151.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/SSVC/data/2016/CVE-2016-0151.json","https://github.com/SionThanatos/windows-vuln-sok/blob/c787317758a44da3b624e7b8f4cb5b78f5430de6/CVEs/CVE-2016-0151[ntoskrnl-ProcMgr][Arbitrary%20File%20Create][Elevation%20of%20Privilege]/CVE-2016-0151_42452213.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-0151.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-0151.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0099","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1010","title":"Adobe Flash Player 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），攻击者可通过构造特制的 Flash 内容诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件触发该漏洞。由于 Flash Player 在处理内存分配时未对整数值进行有效边界检查，导致整数溢出，进而可被利用实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 OS X 平台上的 Adobe Flash Player 18.0.0.333 之前版本及 19.x 至 21.x 系列中 21.0.0.182 之前版本、Linux 平台上的 11.2.202.577 之前版本，以及 Adobe AIR 21.0.0.176 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开文件），成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。Adobe 已在 2016 年 3 月安全公告中发布修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1010"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-03-12T15:59:25.090","updated":"2026-06-17T00:41:06.880","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 Windows/macOS 版 21.0.0.182 或 Linux 版 11.2.202.577 及以上版本，Adobe AIR 升级至 21.0.0.176 及以上版本。由于 Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准。如暂时无法卸载，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件（Chrome: chrome://settings/content/flash；IE: 管理加载项中禁用 Shockwave Flash Object）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00022.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00023.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00024.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00032.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/84308","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035251","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb16-08.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201603-07","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10108.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1010.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2016/1xxx/CVE-2016-1010.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/08480241ef57d4c4abee6c051883b0fd90961f23/2016/CVE-2016-1010.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-1010/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-1010.txt","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/116707.txt","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-1010.md","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/XuanwuLab/2016/2016_04_07.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0004","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0099","title":"微软 Windows Secondary Logon 服务本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Secondary Logon Service 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，服务在处理请求句柄时未正确验证输入数据大小。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过构造恶意应用程序触发漏洞，获取系统管理员权限。受影响版本包括 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows Server 2012 及 Windows 10 早期版本。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需在目标系统上具有本地账户权限，通过运行特制应用程序实现权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0099"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-03-09T11:59:09.590","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:55.360","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2016年3月安全更新 MS16-032（对应补丁 KB3143141/KB3143142 等，视具体 Windows 版本通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装）。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 Secondary Logon 服务（运行 services.msc 找到 \"Secondary Logon\" 设为禁用并停止）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响需要二次登录凭据的程序运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/84034","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035210","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-032","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39574/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39719/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39809/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40107/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0099.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2016-0099/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-0099.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0099","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2016-0099/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0099.txt","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/325d4883b5fe156c18fd47e477e38a13d3899546/README_2017.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/25620.txt","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2016/CVE-2016-0099.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-0099/MS16-032-zcgonvh.md","https://github.com/zcgonvh/MS16-032"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0022","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0752","title":"Ruby on Rails Action View 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Ruby on Rails 的 Action View 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者利用应用程序对 render 方法的无限制调用，在路径名中提供 \"..\"（点号）序列，即可绕过目录访问限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Rails 3.2.22.1 之前、4.0.x 及 4.1.x 在 4.1.14.1 之前、4.2.x 在 4.2.5.1 之前、5.x 在 5.0.0.beta1.1 之前的版本。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发该漏洞，通过构造恶意请求即可实现文件读取，可能导致敏感配置信息、源代码等被泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0752"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-16T02:59:06.783","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:09.067","remediation":"立即将 Rails 升级至以下修复版本：Rails 3.x → 3.2.22.1，Rails 4.0.x → 4.0.x 最新补丁版，Rails 4.1.x → 4.1.14.1，Rails 4.2.x → 4.2.5.1，Rails 5.x → 5.0.0.beta1.1。同时禁止在 render 方法中使用未经校验的用户输入作为文件路径，对所有路径参数进行白名单校验与目录遍历字符（..）过滤，可在应用层中间件中统一拦截包含 .. 的请求路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2016-February/178044.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2016-February/178069.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-04/msg00053.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2016-02/msg00034.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2016-02/msg00043.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-0296.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3464","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/01/25/13","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/81801","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034816","https://groups.google.com/forum/message/raw?msg=ruby-security-ann/335P1DcLG00/JXcBnTtZEgAJ","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40561/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40561","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0752.md","https