"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0033.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0003","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0040","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核权限提升漏洞（CVE-2016-0040）影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/2008 R2 SP1 和 Windows 7 SP1 等版本。该漏洞源于微软 Windows 内核的内存访问控制保护机制缺陷，攻击者可通过精心构造的应用程序触发内核漏洞，绕过权限验证，实现对系统功能的未经授权控制，达到提权目的。用户无需额外权限即可通过恶意软件触发漏洞，漏洞利用过程可能涉及加载恶意驱动、触发内核调用、绕过安全检查等技术手段，最终导致攻击者获取系统管理员或内核级权限，能够任意读取/修改系统文件，安装后门，窃取敏感信息或破坏系统稳定性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8（危 重级），危害等级严重。微软已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新操作系统以获取最新补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0040"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-10T11:59:06.440","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:50.320","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 2 月安全更新 MS16-016 (KB3124280)，适用于 Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装对应补丁包。如无法立即打补丁，可暂时禁用本地用户账户的非必要权限、限制非管理员用户运行可执行文件、启用 Windows Defender 实时防护并部署 CVE-2016-0040 对应的 YARA 检测规则作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快通过 WSUS/WSUS Offline/SCCM 推送补丁至全网资产，并使用 Microsoft Baseline Security Analyzer (MBSA) 验证补丁安装状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034985","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-014","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44586/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0040","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44586","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0040.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/34ec06c5d813d44f45c11d453307aba73a1b3508/2016/CVE-2016-0040.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/8f1453ee08ac75f42eae613c6ab3cc784a63039